WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
 What's up, Marvel fans?

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.700
We're here with Jacob
Batalon who plays Ned Leeds.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.230
This is a huge film.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.560
Where do we start
with Ned in this one?

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.360
 Oh my goodness.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:07.350
Ned is reeling, you know?

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.700
His best friend's identity just
has been revealed to the world.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:11.070
So he is just like,
what does he do next?

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:12.300
What are the folks up to now?

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.560
Like we're planning what to do.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.640
It's crazy.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.470
 Does Ned to get on
the action on this one?

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.630
 Oh my goodness, look
you wouldn't believe.

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:20.710
Ned and MJ are killing it.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:21.510
 Yes.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:23.490
So what was it like working
with Benedict Cumberbatch?

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:24.630
 I mean, unbelievable.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.520
He's like so professional
but also such

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.230
a funny, amazing human being.

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.300
And everyone on the
cast has been amazing.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.160
Like every legend that's been
on has been just amazing.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.160
 So we know Ned's arc
throughout these films,

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.270
but what has been your
journey through this?

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.130
 I feel like--

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:39.600
I mean, I've accomplished
everything that I've

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.600
wanted to accomplish with Ned.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.433
I feel like he's definitely
become the guy in the chair

00:00:42.433 --> 00:00:43.600
to like in the action.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.900
So I think in that way
he's had a great time.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:46.770
So, yeah.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:49.300
 If you can have any
Spider-man gadget in real life,

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.310
what would you choose?

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:52.870
 Probably the web
wings so I can fly.

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:53.670
 That's awesome, Jacob.

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:54.960
Thank you so much.
Enjoy the movie.

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:56.040
Thank you.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:59.690
[MUSIC PLAYING]

